            <tr><td>Checking GitHub sign-in, after first-run setup (at launch before 0.6.4)</td><td>api.github.com (or your GitHub Enterprise host)</td><td>Your gh CLI or GH_TOKEN sign-in, unless you signed in to the GitHub connector separately or signed out</td></tr>
            <tr><td>Starting dictation for the first time</td><td>Hugging Face</td><td>Only the request</td></tr>
            <tr><td>An agent adds a GIF to its reply</td><td>KLIPY</td><td>The agent's search words (never yours) and a one-way hash of your install</td></tr>
